{"t":"AEE","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Ameren Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":8913,"hq":"Saint Louis, MO, United States","website":"https://www.amereninvestors.com","summary_en":"Ameren Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a public utility holding company in the United States. The company operates through four segments: Ameren Missouri, Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution, Ameren Illinois Natural Gas, and Ameren Transmission. It engages in the rate-regulated electric generation, transmission, and distribution business and natural gas transmission and distribution business. The company also generates electricity through coal, nuclear, and natural gas, as well as renewable energy, including hydroelectric, wind, methane gas, and solar energy centers. It serves residential, commercial, and industrial customers. Ameren Corporation was founded in 1881 and is headquartered in Saint Louis, Missouri.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Ameren Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국에서 공공 유틸리티 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 Ameren Missouri, Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution, Ameren Illinois Natural Gas 및 Ameren Transmission의 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 요금 규제형 발전, 송전, 배전 사업과 천연가스 송배전 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 석탄, 원자력, 천연가스뿐만 아니라 수력, 풍력, 메탄가스, 태양광 에너지 센터를 포함한 재생 에너지를 통해 전기를 생산합니다. 주거용, 상업용 및 산업용 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Ameren Corporation은 1881년에 설립되었으며 미주리 주 세인트 루이스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":114.88,"mcap":31814580224.0,"pe":19.97913,"fpe":19.72138,"peg":2.4012,"ps":3.7062652,"pb":2.2390707,"ev_ebitda":13.597,"div":2.61,"beta":0.423,"hi52":118.32,"lo52":96.57},"fin":{"rev":8584000000.0,"rev_g":0.067,"eps_g":0.03,"gross":0.52586,"op":0.28588,"net":0.18628,"roe":0.11775,"fcf":-2546125056.0,"cash":40000000.0,"debt":22513000448.0,"de":157.038,"eps":5.75,"feps":5.82515},"own":{"short":0.0618,"inst":0.92350996,"insider":0.00321},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":117.98333,"median":118.5,"high":127.7,"low":104.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.89